WEBVTT

00:04:29.954 --> 00:04:32.079
and many runs have gone extinct.

00:04:32.663 --> 00:04:34.163
So back in the '90s,

00:04:34.204 --> 00:04:36.288
the Nimiipuu people
told the state of Idaho,

00:04:36.288 --> 00:04:39.621
"Hey, we'd like to bring Coho salmon
back to the Snake River."

00:04:39.663 --> 00:04:42.663
The state Fish and Wildlife guys
were like, "I don't think so."

00:04:42.996 --> 00:04:44.663
But the tribe did it anyway.

00:04:44.704 --> 00:04:47.954
They got eggs that one
of the hatcheries was going to throw away,

00:04:47.996 --> 00:04:52.121
incubated them and basically snuck
the fish back into the river.

00:04:52.954 --> 00:04:54.663
And now they're doing so well,

00:04:54.704 --> 00:04:57.579
that the state has reopened
the sport fishery.

00:04:57.621 --> 00:05:01.288
And the tribe is reintroducing Coho
to a bunch of other rivers.